meta {
  name: List tenants
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/v1/tenants
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

params:query {
  ~kind: carrier
  ~status: active
  ~limit: 50
  ~cursor: 
}

headers {
  ~X-Act-On-Tenant: 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
}

assert {
  res.status: eq 200
  res.body.data: isDefined
}

docs {
  `GET /v1/tenants`

  Lists tenants (own fleet and carriers) the caller may see. Support principals get 403.

  - **Auth:** Bearer access token (`{{accessToken}}`, set by `auth/Login`)
  - **Capabilities:** `platform:manage_tenants`, `fleet:manage_subcontractors`
  - **Listeners:** internal
  - **Success:** `200`; `data` is a list of objects with `id`, `kind`, `code`, `nameTh`, `nameEn`, `status`; `nextCursor` pages
  - **Query `kind`**: own_fleet or carrier
  - **Query `status`**: Tenant status
  - **Query `limit`**: Page size (positive integer)
  - **Query `cursor`**: Opaque cursor from the previous page's nextCursor
  - **Header `X-Act-On-Tenant`**: Platform staff only: act on this tenant (uuid) or * for all tenants (read-only).
}
